    {
      "source": "<code>type</code> - must not be null.",
      "translation": "<code>type</code> 不能为 null。",
      "count": 4
    },
    {
      "source": "Returns the map base type for the given type, i.e. the one that's considered the logical map interface (<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/util/Map.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.util\"><code>Map</code></a>\nfor <code>HashMap</code> etc.).",
      "translation": "返回给定类型的映射基类型，即被视为逻辑映射接口（例如，对于<code>HashMap</code>等类型为<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/util/Map.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.util\"><code>Map</code></a>）的类型。",
      "count": 3
    },
    {
      "source": "Returns whether the given type is considered a <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/util/Collection.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.util\"><code>Collection</code></a> type.",
      "translation": "返回给定的类型是否被视为<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/util/Collection.html\" title=\"java.util 中的类或接口\"><code>Collection</code></a>类型。",
      "count": 3
    },
    {
      "source": "Returns whether the given type is considered a <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/util/Map.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.util\"><code>Map</code></a> type.",
      "translation": "返回给定的类型是否被视为 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/util/Map.html\" title=\"java.util 中的类或接口\"><code>Map</code></a> 类型。",
      "count": 3
    },
    {
      "source": "Registers all converters to transform Java-native collections into custom ones and back in the given\n<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/core/convert/converter/ConverterRegistry.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.core.convert.converter\"><code>ConverterRegistry</code></a>.",
      "translation": "注册所有转换器，以便在指定的<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/core/convert/converter/ConverterRegistry.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.core.convert.converter\"><code>ConverterRegistry</code></a>中将 Java 原生集合转换为自定义集合，并反向转换。",
      "count": 3
    },
    {
      "source": "Returns all custom collection and map types.",
      "translation": "返回所有自定义集合和映射类型。",
      "count": 3
    },
    {
      "source": "Returns all types that are allowed pagination return types.",
      "translation": "返回所有允许分页的返回类型。",
      "count": 3
    },
    {
      "source": "Returns all unwrapper functions that transform the custom collections into Java-native ones.",
      "translation": "返回所有将自定义集合转换为 Java 原生类型的解包函数。",
      "count": 3
    },
    {
      "source": "Returns whether the given type is a map base type.",
      "translation": "返回给定的类型是否为 Map 基类型。",
      "count": 3
    },
