    {
      "source": "Central API to expose information about custom collections present for Spring Data. Exposes custom collection and map\ntypes and registers converters to convert them from and to Java-native collections.",
      "translation": "中央 API 用于暴露 Spring Data 中存在的自定义集合信息。该 API 会暴露自定义集合和映射类型，并注册转换器以在它们与 Java 原生集合之间进行转换。",
      "count": 2
    },
